onvergence refuses without a brief; a tagged finding files as one finding; and SUCCESSOR at the plan cap writes no pass record. An ordinary review reading scope includes the delegated-decisions record and filed plan critiques, while a convergence scope excludes both. A plan critique ties every severity class to reachability, counts a fail-open, data-loss, or security path only when a supported workflow or the kit's own routes reach it, and limits a rare or contrived path to MINOR at most or dismissal; its confirming round treats a new finding as BLOCKER or MAJOR only when it is a reachable fail-open, data-loss, or Done-when gap.\"\ndocs/test/test-cases.toml-3531-automated = \"Yes\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
